virals.text:
Claude, ChatGPT, Codex, Gemini and DeepSeek  can now share one computer.

@SimularAI launched Box, a computer in the cloud that any AI agent can use. 

Claude, ChatGPT, Codex, Gemini or DeepSeek can open apps, run the terminal and fill in forms on it, and your logins stay in https://t.co/pUS4vpcTUn

